{
  "work_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox",
  "source_path": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox.json",
  "source_language": "cop",
  "target_language": "eng",
  "provenance": {
    "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12": {
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol",
      "prompt_version": "bulk-2026-10-12",
      "date": "2026-10-12",
      "script": "scripts.embed_eval.translate"
    },
    "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14": {
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol",
      "prompt_version": "bulk-2026-10-12",
      "date": "2026-10-14",
      "script": "__main__"
    }
  },
  "translations": [
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0000",
      "source_sha256": "4c6e8b785e93924e",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "If the fox—that is, you, the slave of Mammon—does not cry out loudly, the lion—that is, I, the slave of Christ—will remain quiet."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0001",
      "source_sha256": "b34f8723581b10b8",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "I know that you are not fighting against me, but against Jesus, who dwells among the Christians."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0002",
      "source_sha256": "a56ce2962e8646e1",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Jesus, in turn, is a match for you and your father, the devil, who dwells in you and in whom you place your hope."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0003",
      "source_sha256": "658ccb91c203d4ef",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "They too, together with their father who dwells in them, Jesus, in whom they put their trust."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0004",
      "source_sha256": "ff75ffcc2f6f28fd",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "No one who has Jesus will ever be put to shame, as you said."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0005",
      "source_sha256": "86b2ed2c637637bf",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The shame of this world and the glory of this world—I have rejected them, for I know what I am looking forward to."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0006",
      "source_sha256": "76c96c4cac9ced38",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "What use do those who have glory and honor from Jesus have for human glory and honor?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0007",
      "source_sha256": "af32570dad0600bc",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For just as those who truly have Jesus do not practice robbery, contrary to what you said about me, that I carried off your gods in a raid,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0008",
      "source_sha256": "fc665e093fac3066",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and that I had your disgrace and shame fastened to the doorposts of your house,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0009",
      "source_sha256": "dd7b5612a9ae7d52",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "written on sheets of papyrus, while your urine in jars was poured out like wine over the lintels of your house, and into your mouth and the mouths of those like you,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0010",
      "source_sha256": "96acaf7d261d885c",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "so there is no freedom for those who put their trust in Cronus—that is, you and those like you in unbelief and every kind of impurity."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0011",
      "source_sha256": "5d9d0f5f2db412ae",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "What deed or what statement among the things you said does not testify against you that you belong to Satan?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0012",
      "source_sha256": "c52d4a574c4448ea",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Was it the letters that you tore up? Or did I not know, before I sent them, that you would tear them up,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0013",
      "source_sha256": "e2cd114d9e4725b9",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "you accomplice of those who cut the columns of the scroll with the scribe’s knife—the scroll containing the words that the prophets spoke to them in God’s name—"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0014",
      "source_sha256": "4b3dcdc04af5654a",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and threw them into the burning coals?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0015",
      "source_sha256": "239c6f2ef9781ab2",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Again, as you said, “The people and my stewards bring things to him.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0016",
      "source_sha256": "84fd1aabd7c89d3b",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "You are telling us and revealing your wickedness: you did not want God’s children to bring an offering to his church,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0017",
      "source_sha256": "3964cc7daba1f405",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "or to do even a single good deed in Jesus’ name."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0018",
      "source_sha256": "c14a92c7f70904d1",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "You will rejoice if you hear that they have gone to places where demons are consulted,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0019",
      "source_sha256": "87ac5946177c7ed0",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "because you yourself worship and serve the creation rather than the one who created everything, Jesus, who is blessed forever and ever,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0020",
      "source_sha256": "d1d7a15bc174898e",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "rather than hearing or seeing them go before God in every place where they call upon him, blessing him and giving him glory."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0021",
      "source_sha256": "7dd4547268b40787",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Or if there are more than the crowds of whom you said, “They bring things to him,”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0022",
      "source_sha256": "d745bd537faa6cd8",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "if they lavish these things on me without restraint, I too am rightly their servant, because they are my brothers, gathering for them into treasuries in heaven the things they give to honor God."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0023",
      "source_sha256": "cf9977d37ba96754",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Did they bring them out of your house or your parents’ house?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0024",
      "source_sha256": "88a415654cf2a191",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "You are seizing things that do not belong to you, you wicked man."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0025",
      "source_sha256": "cd0749b8939e9b2e",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "But you also act wickedly and put obstacles in the way of those who give to the poor."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0026",
      "source_sha256": "961b429bc12be693",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "They know that what they give, or what they use to show mercy to those in need, belongs to Christ, who gave it to them for their enjoyment and so that they might become rich in good deeds."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0027",
      "source_sha256": "2311bb479d5e221d",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Am I, then, still living right on top of your head,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0028",
      "source_sha256": "6d6ac6c3a0e5f05b",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "since you say, “How long will his delay last? He says, ‘I will go,’ but keeps putting it off day after day.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0029",
      "source_sha256": "aaeb8316cf32d7f2",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Why am I such a great burden to you in all this,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0030",
      "source_sha256": "baa2083395cb1df4",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "because I went to the kings, or did not go?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0031",
      "source_sha256": "afef01d47741f248",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Do not heaven and earth, and everything in them, belong to Christ?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0032",
      "source_sha256": "2dfdca16e08cd62e",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Does your father Cronus himself possess anything at all except sins, which you and those like you cultivate for him?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0033",
      "source_sha256": "9010db44fc82cce3",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "You sow and gather in for him unbelief, lies, acts of violence, blasphemies, and every evil deed."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0034",
      "source_sha256": "d75dc738afcdc5fa",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "If you were a weed growing by yourself like this, it would be right to leave you alone until harvest time, according to the word of the Lord whom you have blasphemed."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0035",
      "source_sha256": "a9466f2d0e31ac76",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "But you are a thorn and a bramble along the roads, obstructing those who walk there. Therefore it is right to cut you down and tear out your root."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0036",
      "source_sha256": "a27b8add26aaacbd",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And since you also said in your empty words,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0037",
      "source_sha256": "4f4ee481631c3f8b",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "“If he were truly a monk, would he commit three murders during the forty days?”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0038",
      "source_sha256": "7dd040683c11229f",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "calling the pigs and the cow that I slaughtered in the pagans’ houses “murders,”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0039",
      "source_sha256": "1939fbf6dc31199e",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "I too will say this in response to your deceitful words:"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0040",
      "source_sha256": "90dd4aff9012cd4e",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "If what I did was not right, because I publicly exposed idol worshipers, then how great is your condemnation for transgressing during the forty days,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0041",
      "source_sha256": "f4674d8d12d0a602",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and during the great and holy Easter festival, which everyone observes, including even the other God-loving kings?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0042",
      "source_sha256": "7dda3fe11c6a2ef2",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "But you make your cooks work for you during it, living in luxury and deceiving without fear, and making others deceive along with you."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0043",
      "source_sha256": "64be7efa70d87acb",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And again, because you sent word to me,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0044",
      "source_sha256": "c86f07d5e1c9d74d",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "“Come and search my houses to see whether you find an idol in them,”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0045",
      "source_sha256": "43dc7df0aae90e7e",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "when I searched it on another occasion—"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0046",
      "source_sha256": "1876e9b90980e464",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "your house—didn't I find an idol in it?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0047",
      "source_sha256": "c5990b1b6880eb54",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Or do you have no others besides those I took away?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0048",
      "source_sha256": "a92b14884437678a",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Or if I remove the idols in your house, will I also be able to hide the sun in the sky, the moon, and the stars that you worship?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0049",
      "source_sha256": "994768f0ac500ee2",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Or shall I build walls at the places where they set, to keep you from praying toward the west?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0050",
      "source_sha256": "9b12062d791caccf",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Or I will keep watch over this river and your canals to prevent you from casting Cronus into the waters of the irrigation channels."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0051",
      "source_sha256": "72631b90f1e843b8",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "So stop speaking these lying and deceitful words,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0052",
      "source_sha256": "6a789e1d6d6bfcc3",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "you who are sunk in great wickedness."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0053",
      "source_sha256": "f9d2f2aa5cbaff8c",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For just as you are godless, so you oppress the poor with your acts of violence."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0054",
      "source_sha256": "1a4f2980e6d53bc9",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Or is this not another kind of persecution, your pursuit of people, especially the priests of the church,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0055",
      "source_sha256": "479bec2ffa82a853",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "until you drive them out of their houses, even at this time, amid the great sufferings afflicting the land, while you enter their properties,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0056",
      "source_sha256": "9f7a5f150f8f98e8",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "where there is no son, no father, none of them at all, because they have fled?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0057",
      "source_sha256": "69256160992ddc31",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "You take their livestock, their wagon, and their chaff, bringing them to your fields and forcing them to go around those fields beyond their strength."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0058",
      "source_sha256": "6b4c80433fa588e7",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And what about the great Passover festival? You do not allow them time off to celebrate it."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0059",
      "source_sha256": "57e2e6a6fb346989",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Even the new boats you have built—you make them launch them into the water on that day, instead of mourning on it."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0060",
      "source_sha256": "39f2875660bcb93a",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "You have made them shout for joy against their will."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0061",
      "source_sha256": "7531e44354c869d7",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Who can recount all your evil deeds?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0062",
      "source_sha256": "e841825c7347ac99",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Likewise, you slaughter your ox when it is about to die, or when it wears out and is no longer useful for your work,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0063",
      "source_sha256": "9f8d2246a88316c2",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and divide it up piece by piece as you please, imposing it on them—even on widows, old men, old women, orphans, and strangers."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0064",
      "source_sha256": "8aa1449878cd53f0",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "You exact money from them beyond the pieces’ value, until you have collected twice the price of the ox for a very little meat, bones, and worthless things."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0065",
      "source_sha256": "5fb76981d058cdad",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Likewise, you give them calves and sheep individually to raise until they grow up, and then you take them away."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0066",
      "source_sha256": "aa9403ade40923d1",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Some you make them give you as a gift, and you do nothing good for them in return."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0067",
      "source_sha256": "673eda3e6cfeef73",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 12,
      "text": "Others, too, are to raise them for you in this same way: horses, donkeys, sheep, calves, and pigs,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0068",
      "source_sha256": "428c43701bb61222",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "If only you would stop at that!"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0069",
      "source_sha256": "9b134765c1e0775d",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For whatever you desire among their livestock,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0070",
      "source_sha256": "737ffef22603e210",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "or, for that matter, other possessions,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0071",
      "source_sha256": "405e0aee01ce33dd",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "you seize from them,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0072",
      "source_sha256": "6f8e21268e06eb3b",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "some for nothing,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0073",
      "source_sha256": "a7f2c76c9bce7341",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "others for very low prices,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0074",
      "source_sha256": "2221aa1dbdac567f",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "besides bread, wine, food, and chaff,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0075",
      "source_sha256": "cb73909f4394ddc0",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and barley for your livestock, and everything else."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0076",
      "source_sha256": "991460bc0b50b5ed",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Likewise, you gather them to guard you on the boats when you flee from the barbarians."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0077",
      "source_sha256": "407bf2a52cbd5cab",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Or is the barbarian not pursuing them too?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0078",
      "source_sha256": "9a1c670589ef3fa2",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Their wives, their children, and their meager belongings are on their animals"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0079",
      "source_sha256": "ec79686fd1e69510",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and in their carts, while they too flee from their own places to other places to save themselves."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0080",
      "source_sha256": "e4ba9f78543e32b4",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "This is how many of them hire people at their own expense and send them to you to guard you."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0081",
      "source_sha256": "d274cf33db516ba6",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And you do not stop at these things."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0082",
      "source_sha256": "980a91d29e3cdf8b",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Instead, you keep adding to your acts of oppression."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0083",
      "source_sha256": "440be8303bd4076c",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Likewise, you demand from some of them a measure of wheat per household,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0084",
      "source_sha256": "9f8b0757083ecb91",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 12,
      "text": "for they levy on people—on some twenty-five measures, on others an artaba—"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0085",
      "source_sha256": "a843af8f2383b988",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 12,
      "text": "under the pretext of contamination at threshing floors,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0086",
      "source_sha256": "2213a03edcb3b54b",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "while they weep and say, “We do not want to work in mud."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0087",
      "source_sha256": "2f51551c15dd77c3",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "We have no bread to eat."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0088",
      "source_sha256": "02cad794e8c623c3",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Work of this kind is not our concern.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0089",
      "source_sha256": "f362bf0ee85be12b",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 12,
      "text": "while our children are hungry and naked."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0090",
      "source_sha256": "ab5454b06bdc17ef",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Most of them testify that they do not usually work in mud."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0091",
      "source_sha256": "40309412b2cdce0e",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Or are they not the ones who make bricks for them until they have built them,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0092",
      "source_sha256": "1576a0aa9b45743c",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "along with the other houses for which you make them produce bricks?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0093",
      "source_sha256": "e37d7d7ff8341e38",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Or are the villages also estates?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0094",
      "source_sha256": "82b9037f8f24fbac",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Did you yourselves build their houses in them?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0095",
      "source_sha256": "f0181736e70f8726",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And are these the only hardships you inflict on them through your bricks, your pressed wine, all your burdens, and your acts of oppression?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0096",
      "source_sha256": "6f7e26c11d707906",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "O people whom the voice threatens, saying, “For those who are contentious, who disobey the truth but obey injustice, there will be wrath and anger, affliction and distress upon every human soul that does evil.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0097",
      "source_sha256": "27f73ace92348ecd",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 12,
      "text": "Nevertheless, I will speak before you, God of hosts, the Almighty. Do not be angry at my foolishness."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0098",
      "source_sha256": "dc53a43fab11ad1a",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "I know that you forget nothing."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0099",
      "source_sha256": "75d0fb8f77e3aa07",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "You are the one who spoke through your holy prophets before that savage man, Pharaoh, saying, “Let my people go,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0100",
      "source_sha256": "4c508e771b2600e3",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "so that they may serve me or celebrate a feast for me.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0101",
      "source_sha256": "735c00d2342a85ba",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 12,
      "text": "You are also the one who said among them, “Be still and know that I am God.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0102",
      "source_sha256": "ce0f5d52ca21caf4",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 12,
      "text": "So have compassion on your people, you who are patient and whose mercy is great,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0103",
      "source_sha256": "b47dff002d62d472",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 12,
      "text": "and rescue them from the hands of those who oppress them,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0104",
      "source_sha256": "fc6d299bf8de4669",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 12,
      "text": "as you did for your people Israel at that time, so that they may be still and know that there is no other God besides you."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0105",
      "source_sha256": "62db94d738c49f37",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 12,
      "text": "Or do you not see that the Greeks, the nations, and the godless have been unable to know you because they have not ceased their unbelief"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0106",
      "source_sha256": "1401a5ac44ef4d2e",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 12,
      "text": "and all their impurities?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0107",
      "source_sha256": "6b82f34f21c776d4",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Put a stop, then, to every act of lawlessness"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0108",
      "source_sha256": "d8e13bdabc7a5bf3",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and every act of oppression everywhere,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0109",
      "source_sha256": "ba0b4ef3a8cdc154",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "removing them from those who are oppressed, from one end of the earth to the other end of the inhabited world,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0110",
      "source_sha256": "38135957e8ec4633",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "so that those who know you may be free to serve you."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0111",
      "source_sha256": "087292c510117719",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 9,
      "text": "For they cannot serve you while serving their oppressors."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0112",
      "source_sha256": "eb0ca2686662ccd2",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 9,
      "text": "If you had not rescued your people Israel at that time from the hands of that lawless Nebuchadnezzar,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0113",
      "source_sha256": "2c91b22aa95c22be",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 9,
      "text": "and all the others like him who humiliated them when you handed them over to them because you were angry with them,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0114",
      "source_sha256": "b967f06776f9af50",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 9,
      "text": "even if they sought you in that place, they would not have been able to sing your praises as they wished,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0115",
      "source_sha256": "f0de8fc7332de916",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 9,
      "text": "because they had no freedom to speak openly while enslaved to so many tasks."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_fox#CopScr.shenoute-fox.000.0116",
      "source_sha256": "9445a107150a5870",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 12,
      "text": "As they said, “How can we sing the song of the Lord’s house in a foreign land?”"
